e we barely  get any time with the characters the  actors let you know who the characters  are with very little because their  performances are just so captivating  euphoria on the whole is that too and  though i have my nitpicks things work  really well to tell a story that you  just get lost in there's search it on an  atmosphere to it where it just feels  like a piece of art at points and all in  all i don't have that many bad things to  say about it the overall show is as  psychedelic as the subject matter and it  works on pretty much every level for me  even if you don't like the story i think  the way it's produced still keeps you  engaged and this was another brilliant  season all in all really enjoyed our  return to the world of euphoria and it  gets a 9 out of 10. i'd of course love  to hear your thoughts as nine is a  pretty high score and i know people are  going back and forth on it make sure you  leave them in the comments below and if  you want something else to watch we have  a full breakdown of peacemaker linked on  screen right now and also another video  for your punk ass hopefully i see over  there and with that other way thanks for  sticking through this video hope you  enjoy the rest of the week peace i'm out  peace
 

